# Gate D4 route for Town04_Opt, from survey_ring.py against the packaged map
# (sha d7834b3454e1e372491ae79ccf14eb373ce45add-dirty), measured 2026-09-16.
#
# NO SPAWN POINT GIVES A JUNCTION-FREE CLOSED LAP. survey_ring.py reports
# loop_m = 0 for every spawn point on the map: each walk ends at a junction
# before it can return to its start. The top of the ranking is
#
#   idx   loop_m  clean_m  junction_at_m
#    40        0      858            858
#    42        0      858            858
#    41        0      856            856
#   343        0      668            668
#
# so LAP_M is the longest junction-free run, not a lap length. Gate D4 as the
# plan words it ("one closed lap") cannot be met on this map without driving
# through a junction, which is where VisionPilot is known to leave its lane.
# Treat a run that reaches LAP_M with |cte| under the limit as the real result
# and read D4_LAP_FAIL reason=timeout in that light.
SPAWN_INDEX=40
LAP_M=858
